WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:05.800
[Original electronic score]
A line of railcars crosses the mountain valley.

00:00:05.800 --> 00:00:12.200
Silver-and-orange carriages pass the signal
as the viewpoint travels along the railway.

00:00:12.200 --> 00:00:18.000
The cars pass more signals while the mountain
ridgeline remains visible beneath the sunset.
